{"unit_id":"kenz1117__dsh-ui-rainbowspeak#card-zh","repo":"kenz1117/dsh-ui-rainbowspeak","commit":"4552ef65c6f950b70e84f36b2afc68135efcee46","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"RainbowSpeak（虹语）为 DSH 网页聊天输入框添加流动的彩虹边框，并在窗口浮层放置可互动的桌宠小虹。它通过 composer dock、设置页和 shell overlay 接入客户端；边框会随会话运行、等待交互和错误状态变化。用户可调整启用状态、速度、宽度、配色和桌宠偏好，并选择五种球形角色。宿主侧将回合开始与结束原因作为只读边界流提供给桌宠，用于区分完成、取消和错误。适合希望个性化 DSH 外观并用轻量桌宠查看会话状态的网页客户端用户；无需额外 API key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:302-370","src/client/settings.tsx:74-170","src/index.ts:128-163"]}
{"unit_id":"kenz1117__dsh-ui-rainbowspeak#card-en","repo":"kenz1117/dsh-ui-rainbowspeak","commit":"4552ef65c6f950b70e84f36b2afc68135efcee46","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"RainbowSpeak adds a moving rainbow border to the DSH web composer and an interactive pet in the window overlay. The border reflects session activity. Settings control speed, width, palette, and pet appearance. Host turn events distinguish completion, cancellation, and errors. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:302-370","src/client/settings.tsx:74-170","src/index.ts:128-163"]}
